  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tAgilex_Cobot_Magic_heat_burger\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tDataset Description\n\t\n\nThis dataset uses an extended format based on LeRobot and is fully compatible with LeRobot.\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tTask Preview\n\t\n\n\nView Video Directly\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tOverview\n\t\n\n\nTotal Episodes: 819\n\nTotal Frames: 2478415\n\nFPS: 30\n\nDataset Size: 131.36 GB\n\nRobot Name: Agilex_Cobot_Magic\n\nEnd-Effector Type: two_finger_gripper\n\nTeleoperation Type: Due to some reasons, this dataset temporarily cannot provide the teleoperation type information.\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/RoboCOIN/Agilex_Cobot_Magic_heat_burger.",
